WEBVTT

00:11.070 --> 00:15.820
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:11.070 --> 00:15.820
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:15.990 --> 00:20.240
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:15.990 --> 00:20.240
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:20.410 --> 00:24.040
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:20.410 --> 00:24.040
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:32.880 --> 00:36.220
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:32.880 --> 00:36.220
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:36.390 --> 00:39.140
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:36.390 --> 00:39.140
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:39.300 --> 00:41.680
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:39.300 --> 00:41.680
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:41.850 --> 00:44.980
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:41.850 --> 00:44.980
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:45.140 --> 00:49.360
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:45.140 --> 00:49.360
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:50.650 --> 00:54.860
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:50.650 --> 00:54.860
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:55.030 --> 00:59.200
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:55.030 --> 00:59.200
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:59.370 --> 01:04.580
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:59.370 --> 01:04.580
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

01:04.750 --> 01:09.540
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

01:04.750 --> 01:09.540
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

01:09.750 --> 01:13.760
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

01:09.750 --> 01:13.760
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

01:13.920 --> 01:17.760
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

01:13.920 --> 01:17.760
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

01:17.930 --> 01:22.850
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

01:17.930 --> 01:22.850
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

01:23.020 --> 01:27.810
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

01:23.020 --> 01:27.810
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

01:27.980 --> 01:31.570
<i>And dream my dream</i>

01:27.980 --> 01:31.570
<i>yume wo miru</i>

01:31.730 --> 01:33.900
<i>And know my dream</i>

01:31.730 --> 01:33.900
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

01:42.280 --> 01:50.580
THE COLLABORATIVE ZAPPLE

01:56.800 --> 01:57.590
I...

01:58.840 --> 02:01.100
W-What is this?!

02:02.640 --> 02:03.680
L-Let go!

02:03.850 --> 02:08.940
Now, now, little girl.
I wouldn't struggle if I were you.

02:09.100 --> 02:10.100
Huh?!

02:10.270 --> 02:13.150
This is the Underground Palace
of the Undead Legion.

02:15.110 --> 02:18.070
We're heading for the entrance
down an extinct volcano.

02:18.240 --> 02:21.160
One wrong move and down you go
into the abyss.

02:22.830 --> 02:25.950
We've imprisoned the girl in a cell.

02:26.120 --> 02:27.000
Good work.

02:27.330 --> 02:31.290
And a message just arrived from a Heyedra.

02:31.460 --> 02:35.590
Hadlar, the Dark Commander,
will be here shortly.

02:35.750 --> 02:37.170
Hadlar?

02:40.720 --> 02:44.850
My name is Baduck.
I'm a swordsman for Princess Leona.

02:45.010 --> 02:46.020
For Leona?!

02:46.180 --> 02:48.730
Well, I'm just
a wandering soldier for now.

02:48.890 --> 02:50.640
Is Princess Leona safe?!

02:50.810 --> 02:51.980
Of course!

02:52.560 --> 02:54.650
The Princess always said,

02:54.820 --> 02:59.780
"We can win once Dai comes.
Everyone hold out until then!"

02:59.950 --> 03:00.780
Huh?

03:02.240 --> 03:04.870
So where's the Princess now?

03:07.330 --> 03:12.920
I was separated from everybody when
the Undead Legion destroyed the temple.

03:13.670 --> 03:15.090
I see.

03:15.670 --> 03:21.220
But, the three most powerful Sages
in Papnica are always with her.

03:21.380 --> 03:24.350
I'm sure they're alive
out there somewhere.

03:26.010 --> 03:31.310
We got split up with Gomechan,
so I guess it's just us now.

03:31.480 --> 03:37.190
That old man's going to be disappointed
when he hears Hyunckel kicked our butts.

03:38.900 --> 03:42.570
Why didn't you use
the power of your mark back there?

03:44.490 --> 03:49.120
Listening to Hyunckel,
I understood how he felt.

03:49.910 --> 03:50.790
You understood?

03:51.750 --> 03:54.460
I was raised by monsters, too.

03:55.080 --> 04:01.260
If somebody ever killed Grampa Brass,
I'd probably hate them.

04:01.550 --> 04:04.590
I couldn't get mad
when I thought about that.

04:04.760 --> 04:09.810
You moron! If we don't beat him,
we can't save Maam or the Princess!

04:11.430 --> 04:15.440
We fight! Once more, together!

04:16.150 --> 04:19.650
The Underground Palace.
It's been 15 years.

04:19.820 --> 04:23.740
So this place used to be your home castle?

04:23.900 --> 04:24.610
Yes.

04:24.780 --> 04:29.280
Well, well, Sir Dark Commander.
I see you're doing quite well.

04:31.660 --> 04:34.500
To what do I owe this visit?

04:35.210 --> 04:37.460
Call it a battlefield inspection.

04:37.920 --> 04:44.550
I know the Dark King ordered you
to kill Dai, but I had my concerns.

04:45.220 --> 04:47.890
Your concerns are unnecessary.

04:48.050 --> 04:52.020
I've already fought him. He was nothing.

04:52.730 --> 04:55.190
Next time, I'll kill him for sure.

04:55.350 --> 04:58.730
Strength-wise, an obvious result.

04:58.900 --> 05:03.780
However, you're a human,
and a former student of Avan.

05:03.940 --> 05:10.030
Flazzard voiced his doubts
that you might somehow fail.

05:11.160 --> 05:14.290
Just let the stupid general whine.

05:14.460 --> 05:15.830
How dare you!

05:16.000 --> 05:21.880
Listen! My orders come directly
from Vearn, the Dark King, himself!

05:22.050 --> 05:24.880
No one, no matter who, may question them!

05:27.800 --> 05:29.220
Very well.

05:29.470 --> 05:31.510
Just one more thing.

05:33.020 --> 05:35.730
Has Crocodine shown up recently?

05:35.890 --> 05:39.310
He left his tank of Resurrection Fluid
before he was fully healed.

05:40.060 --> 05:44.070
I thought he might have gone after Dai.

05:44.230 --> 05:45.610
I haven't seen him.

05:45.780 --> 05:47.990
I see. Very well.

05:48.450 --> 05:51.580
Why don't you stay a while
and look around?

05:51.990 --> 05:55.870
Revel in the memories
of the rise and fall of an empire.

05:57.080 --> 05:59.080
<i>"Dark Commander." Hah!</i>

05:59.250 --> 06:04.880
<i>If you'd been strong enough,
my father wouldn't have died.</i>

06:05.550 --> 06:09.760
<i>Just wait and I'll show you
just how weak you really are.</i>

06:10.510 --> 06:13.260
That insolent brat!

06:13.470 --> 06:18.060
What does Dark King Vearn even see in him?

06:18.270 --> 06:22.150
Perhaps he picked him on whim.
Or perhaps...

06:23.150 --> 06:28.400
<i>It was back when Dark King Vearn
chose the Six Legion Commanders.</i>

06:28.780 --> 06:34.370
My Dark King, I cannot agree
with making Hyunckel a Legion Commander!

06:34.540 --> 06:37.960
He is a human! And a student of Avan!

06:38.500 --> 06:43.090
Hyunckel learned from Avan
in order to kill him.

06:43.290 --> 06:45.460
Quite audacious, wouldn't you say?

06:46.260 --> 06:52.010
Furthermore, should something happen to
my power, the Undead Legion will suffer.

06:52.180 --> 06:57.140
A living human is the best candidate
to comfortably control the Legion.

06:57.310 --> 07:01.020
Why do you favor him so much?

07:01.230 --> 07:02.060
It's his eyes.

07:02.270 --> 07:02.860
His eyes?

07:03.020 --> 07:04.940
Those eyes are magnificent.

07:05.440 --> 07:10.700
Eyes that curse all around them
and burn with aggravated rage.

07:10.860 --> 07:17.160
They are what I seek.
Truly the eyes of an Underworld warrior.

07:20.710 --> 07:26.380
Dark King Vearn is great,
but his motives can be unfathomable.

07:26.550 --> 07:30.800
Regardless, if Dai is killed, so be it.

07:30.970 --> 07:36.220
If Hyunckel fails,
it gives us reason to punish him.

07:37.850 --> 07:39.640
Ah, good morning, Dai!

07:40.310 --> 07:41.810
Oh. Good morning.

07:43.100 --> 07:49.030
This is my old Chain Mail,
but it's still usable.

07:49.440 --> 07:50.610
Thank you.

07:50.780 --> 07:53.280
Say, have you seen Popp anywhere?

07:53.450 --> 07:56.410
Hm? I saw him in the forest earlier.

07:56.580 --> 08:00.200
That's strange.
He never wakes up before me.

08:16.510 --> 08:17.430
Popp!

08:17.600 --> 08:18.850
What's going on?

08:19.010 --> 08:23.640
What does it look like?
I just bound with a new spell.

08:23.810 --> 08:25.150
A new spell?

08:25.310 --> 08:29.480
We can't beat him by sword.
So we'll have to beat him by magic!

08:29.650 --> 08:34.150
Did you forget? His armour repels magic.

08:34.320 --> 08:38.200
Dai, you know the Weather-type spell,
Climatise, right?

08:38.370 --> 08:40.580
Uh, wait, what is it?

08:40.740 --> 08:46.790
I just bound with the spell that
summons lightning clouds, Reclimatise.

08:46.960 --> 08:51.510
It's the most basic
of the spells that control weather.

08:54.680 --> 09:00.810
I've been thinking all night
for a spell that might work on Hyunckel.

09:01.390 --> 09:07.520
And I found one! An attack spell
that's guaranteed to hurt him!

09:08.560 --> 09:10.070
Zapple!

09:10.230 --> 09:11.230
Zapple?

09:11.400 --> 09:12.150
Right!

09:12.650 --> 09:19.370
His armour repels all spells,
but it still has to be made of metal.

09:19.530 --> 09:22.410
That means, the shock
from a Electric-type spell

09:22.580 --> 09:27.120
should penetrate his armour
and damage him directly!

09:27.290 --> 09:31.420
But Zapple is a spell only a Hero can use.

09:31.750 --> 09:34.260
You can't use it, and I...

09:34.670 --> 09:36.680
That's why we do it together!

09:36.840 --> 09:37.340
Huh?!

09:37.510 --> 09:42.100
Zapple summons lightning clouds
and strikes enemies with lightning.

09:42.260 --> 09:45.930
So if I summon the clouds with my spell,

09:46.100 --> 09:50.190
even your Magic Power should be enough
to drop a lightning bolt!

09:50.360 --> 09:51.020
Oh!

09:51.190 --> 09:52.190
I see!

09:52.860 --> 09:57.780
We combine our spells,
defeat him, and save Maam!

09:58.740 --> 10:01.370
Got it! Let's try it out!

10:05.790 --> 10:11.590
Spirits scattered in the heavens,
hear my voice!

10:13.710 --> 10:15.170
Reclimatise!

10:21.180 --> 10:25.890
<i>Maybe this spell
was a little too advanced for me.</i>

10:33.110 --> 10:35.150
D-Do it, Dai!

10:39.070 --> 10:40.570
Zapple!

10:42.950 --> 10:44.620
It worked! I did it!

10:44.790 --> 10:47.620
Y-You dummy! Look closer!

10:47.790 --> 10:48.370
Huh?

10:49.250 --> 10:52.960
You've already got the clouds,
so of course it worked!

10:53.130 --> 10:56.420
What's the point if you miss?!
Do it again!

11:02.720 --> 11:03.600
Open it.

11:09.180 --> 11:13.520
Don't worry.
You're just bait to lure in Dai.

11:13.690 --> 11:15.610
Once I'm finished, you can go.

11:15.770 --> 11:17.400
Huh? You won't kill me?

11:17.570 --> 11:20.280
I won't kill a girl.
Even if she's an enemy.

11:20.450 --> 11:25.450
It's the basic code of a warrior
my father taught me.

11:26.450 --> 11:31.210
My father was the model warrior.
I still believe that.

11:33.380 --> 11:35.750
You respected your father.

11:35.920 --> 11:37.210
Of course.

11:38.130 --> 11:42.760
That's why you hate Master Avan
for taking his life.

11:42.930 --> 11:44.600
That's right!

11:44.760 --> 11:50.770
How could I forgive Avan for killing him
for that justice and peace nonsense?!

11:54.560 --> 11:57.360
Hyunckel, you poor soul.

11:57.730 --> 12:03.530
Your pain of losing your father
was so great, you had to blame someone.

12:03.700 --> 12:06.700
But that doesn't mean
you should hate justice!

12:06.870 --> 12:10.040
That wouldn't make your father happy!

12:10.200 --> 12:16.670
He was in the Dark Army, but your father
was a good, honorable man, wasn't he?

12:17.590 --> 12:18.880
Quiet!

12:19.050 --> 12:23.470
Open your eyes, Hyunckel!
You're a better man than that!

12:24.050 --> 12:28.890
You're not a weakling who would vent
his anger on others out of sorrow!

12:32.520 --> 12:33.190
Shut up!

12:40.280 --> 12:41.490
Hyunckel...

12:45.490 --> 12:46.780
Zapple!

12:51.040 --> 12:55.580
Those kids have been going at it
for half a day. Just how tough are they?

12:55.750 --> 12:57.710
Dai, a little more!

12:59.340 --> 13:00.750
Zapple!

13:03.550 --> 13:06.470
Good! You're starting to hit it!

13:07.970 --> 13:10.760
<i>I struck a defenseless girl.</i>

13:11.470 --> 13:17.060
<i>But, when I look into her eyes,
I find I can't rebut her.</i>

13:20.440 --> 13:22.230
You're still here?!

13:22.400 --> 13:25.650
You seem quite taken by that girl.

13:26.160 --> 13:29.370
With one spell,
I could make her fall in love with you.

13:30.410 --> 13:33.660
You may be strong,
but you lack experience in...

13:34.580 --> 13:35.870
What are you doing?!

13:36.040 --> 13:39.540
You parasite!
You shame of the Six Legion Commanders!

13:39.710 --> 13:40.840
Begone from here!

13:44.420 --> 13:46.050
You'll regret that!

13:46.220 --> 13:51.220
Crocodine lost because
he didn't listen to me!

13:51.680 --> 13:52.720
Wrong.

13:52.890 --> 13:57.020
I bet he lost because
you put stupid ideas in his head!

13:57.190 --> 13:58.770
Y-You'll pay for that!

13:59.440 --> 14:02.400
<i>I no longer have ears for anyone.</i>

14:02.570 --> 14:06.110
<i>I will fight as I see fit!</i>

14:09.950 --> 14:10.990
Zapple!

14:15.620 --> 14:18.000
Good! One more!

14:18.290 --> 14:19.920
Zapple!

14:31.890 --> 14:35.720
Okay, this is good!
Now we can go save Maam!

14:35.890 --> 14:36.850
Yeah!

14:39.520 --> 14:41.940
Hey! Come on, you two!

14:48.030 --> 14:50.570
KASWOOSH
VORTEX-TYPE SPELL

14:53.030 --> 14:55.580
BLOODY SCRYDE

14:56.040 --> 14:58.910
That's the base of the Undead Legion.

14:59.420 --> 15:00.710
So Maam's down there?

15:00.870 --> 15:02.630
Looks like it.

15:02.790 --> 15:07.880
The temple was empty,
so they probably took her down there.

15:08.050 --> 15:09.760
Then Crocodine...

15:10.090 --> 15:12.260
He probably died.

15:12.590 --> 15:16.310
It looked like his wounds
from fighting you hadn't fully healed.

15:17.930 --> 15:20.850
That's strange.
The usual guards aren't there.

15:21.690 --> 15:23.900
Then that's perfect.

15:24.060 --> 15:25.020
Okay.

15:25.940 --> 15:26.900
Let's go!

15:27.070 --> 15:27.740
Right!

15:27.900 --> 15:29.280
-Okay!
-Huh?!

15:29.450 --> 15:30.400
With my mighty sword...

15:30.570 --> 15:32.870
Wait, you don't have to, old timer!

15:33.030 --> 15:36.700
They called me
the greatest swordsman in Papnica!

15:36.870 --> 15:40.160
We need you here
to keep watch just in case!

15:41.080 --> 15:43.790
In that case, I suppose...

15:43.960 --> 15:45.040
We're off then.

15:45.210 --> 15:46.590
Take care!

15:47.050 --> 15:48.300
It's better this way.

15:48.460 --> 15:52.970
No offense to him, but that old man
can't do anything against Hyunckel.

15:53.140 --> 15:54.090
Yeah.

15:54.510 --> 15:58.270
Same with us.
We can't use Zapple underground.

15:58.430 --> 16:01.940
Once we find Maam, we run. Got it?

16:02.310 --> 16:04.400
Hyunckel will be tough to beat.

16:04.560 --> 16:07.190
Dai, I've been thinking.

16:07.360 --> 16:09.690
Hyunckel is in the wrong here.

16:10.110 --> 16:12.240
I get he has his motives...

16:13.070 --> 16:16.620
but that doesn't excuse
destroying Papnica Kingdom!

16:17.240 --> 16:18.080
Popp...

16:19.080 --> 16:19.790
Listen...

16:20.830 --> 16:23.830
<i>when I fought him, I was terrified.</i>

16:24.830 --> 16:27.960
<i>I thought of running away like that one time.</i>

16:29.090 --> 16:33.380
But thinking about justice,
and Maam, and you made me feel

16:33.550 --> 16:36.550
that I had to try no matter what.

16:37.050 --> 16:39.930
When that happened,
I felt a little less scared.

16:40.100 --> 16:42.520
Oh, so I come after Maam?

16:42.890 --> 16:45.770
C-Come on! I'm being serious here!

16:45.940 --> 16:51.990
If Hyunckel chases us outside,
that's when we'll fight!

16:56.200 --> 16:57.120
What's going on?!

16:57.280 --> 16:59.620
The brats have entered the palace!

16:59.790 --> 17:03.410
Lead them to where
Master Hyunckel commanded!

17:03.580 --> 17:04.710
Got it!

17:05.080 --> 17:08.710
<i>Oh no!
I've got to get out of here!</i>

17:10.960 --> 17:13.550
G-Gomechan?!
When did you get in there?!

17:15.050 --> 17:18.890
Oh, you were worried about me
and snuck in.

17:20.350 --> 17:21.430
Thank you.

17:22.180 --> 17:24.140
Gomechan, can you get those?

17:26.940 --> 17:31.280
This place is huge.
We can't find the prison at all.

17:31.440 --> 17:34.700
This used to be Hadlar's Dark Palace.

17:36.450 --> 17:37.320
Frizzle!

17:41.120 --> 17:43.080
The hostage has escaped!

17:43.910 --> 17:44.960
Run!

17:46.960 --> 17:48.130
There they are!

17:49.630 --> 17:51.300
Popp, this way!

17:52.710 --> 17:54.800
It's narrow, but hang in there.

17:55.840 --> 17:59.760
It's an air duct,
so there has to be an exit.

18:07.650 --> 18:09.360
There! An exit!

18:11.730 --> 18:13.280
What is this place?!

18:15.110 --> 18:18.110
This is the Colosseum
of the Underground Palace.

18:19.660 --> 18:21.450
Oh crap! It's a trap!

18:21.620 --> 18:26.160
The Dark Lord Hadlar used to have
prisoners fight monsters,

18:26.330 --> 18:29.790
and he enjoyed watching
the death in this bloody place.

18:30.330 --> 18:34.000
I chose it as the perfect place for you!

18:34.170 --> 18:36.340
He's already fully armoured!

18:37.970 --> 18:40.140
<i>We can see the sky here!</i>

18:40.300 --> 18:42.470
Your time to end has come!

18:42.640 --> 18:44.010
Where's Maam?!

18:44.180 --> 18:48.560
Don't worry. Once you're dead,
I'll have no use for her.

18:48.730 --> 18:50.600
She'll be safely released.

18:50.770 --> 18:54.440
In fact, you can leave as well, Mage.

18:54.610 --> 18:56.320
Th-Thanks but no thanks!

18:56.490 --> 18:59.200
Popp, we'll have to fight here!

18:59.360 --> 19:02.660
Okay! Let's target him
when he raises his sword!

19:02.830 --> 19:07.500
I don't need my sword!
I'll crush you right now!

19:28.310 --> 19:29.940
He's toying with us!

19:30.480 --> 19:32.190
He won't use his sword!

19:32.690 --> 19:34.520
I'll draw his attention!

19:34.980 --> 19:36.940
You summon the clouds!

19:37.320 --> 19:38.610
Are you sure?!

19:38.780 --> 19:39.950
I'll give it a shot!

19:40.110 --> 19:41.740
Have you given up?

19:47.620 --> 19:50.750
Fool! Haven't you realized
you're outmatched?!

19:59.670 --> 20:02.010
<i>He's anticipating my movements?!</i>

20:02.630 --> 20:05.550
<i>Good going, Dai!
Just hold on a little longer!</i>

20:09.930 --> 20:16.400
Spirits scattered in the heavens,
hear my voice!

20:22.280 --> 20:24.780
Is this a hidden room?!

20:25.280 --> 20:27.160
Oh! A treasure chest!

20:31.410 --> 20:33.170
Sh-Should I open it?

20:33.960 --> 20:35.960
Maybe it's a Cannibox.

20:38.090 --> 20:43.180
But it could contain some useful,
powerful legendary weapon.

20:45.430 --> 20:47.140
Th-This is...?!

20:53.230 --> 20:56.060
<i>Just one fight and he's already
keeping up with me?!</i>

20:56.980 --> 20:57.900
Curse you!

21:02.650 --> 21:05.070
What?! Chain Mail?!

21:08.160 --> 21:10.240
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

21:11.910 --> 21:15.670
Very well.
If it's a gruesome death you seek,

21:16.080 --> 21:19.590
I'll end you with my blade of hell!

21:20.000 --> 21:20.840
<i>Here it is!</i>

21:21.010 --> 21:23.010
Time to die!

21:23.170 --> 21:25.010
Popp, now!

21:25.680 --> 21:27.760
Reclimatise!

21:27.930 --> 21:28.970
What?!

21:30.310 --> 21:31.600
Take this!

21:31.770 --> 21:33.100
Zapple!

21:51.660 --> 21:52.950
It worked!

21:56.120 --> 21:58.630
We did it! Hooray! Hooray!

22:20.230 --> 22:25.990
<i>Kindness is the magic of kind people</i>

22:20.230 --> 22:25.990
<i>yasashisa wa yasashii hito ga tsukaeru mahou</i>

22:26.150 --> 22:32.990
<i>Then do I have no choice
But to just be a normal person?</i>

22:26.150 --> 22:32.990
<i>jaa boku wa tada no hito de iru shikanaino?</i>

22:33.160 --> 22:36.210
<i>I'm not sure</i>

22:33.160 --> 22:36.210
<i>doudarou</i>

22:38.500 --> 22:44.170
<i>Even if the place I call home may change</i>

22:38.500 --> 22:44.170
<i>kaeru basho wa ne kawatte yuku kedo</i>

22:44.340 --> 22:46.720
<i>Listen to me, Mother</i>

22:44.340 --> 22:46.720
<i>naa kaasan boku wa</i>

22:46.880 --> 22:52.850
<i>I will never change those I protect</i>

22:46.880 --> 22:52.850
<i>mamoru hito wo kaetari shinai</i>

22:53.310 --> 22:57.520
<i>I wonder what you'd say</i>

22:53.310 --> 22:57.520
<i>anata wa nannte iukana</i>

22:57.690 --> 23:01.730
<i>At times I can be cowardly and small</i>

22:57.690 --> 23:01.730
<i>tokiyori yowaki de chippoke de</i>

23:01.900 --> 23:08.200
<i>What would you say to me
As I hesitate to even hesitate?</i>

23:01.900 --> 23:08.200
<i>mayou koto ni mo mayou boku ni nannte iukana</i>

23:08.360 --> 23:14.030
<i>Unlike the today that I sought</i>

23:08.360 --> 23:14.030
<i>sagashite ita kyou to chigatte</i>

23:14.200 --> 23:19.330
<i>I'm sure you'd laugh at my disappointment</i>

23:14.200 --> 23:19.330
<i>ochikonnde shimau boku wo warau no darou</i>

23:34.100 --> 23:36.390
<i>With his anger towards justice,</i>

23:36.560 --> 23:40.440
<i>Hyunckel's power is overwhelming
in both sword and magic.</i>

23:40.600 --> 23:43.980
<i>Helpless, Dai falls prey
to his Bloody Scryde.</i>

23:44.440 --> 23:50.360
<i>All appears to be over, but Hyunckel
is shocked by a truth that Maam reveals.</i>

23:50.530 --> 23:53.660
<i>Just then, Dai rises again!</i>

23:54.030 --> 23:56.330
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

23:56.490 --> 23:57.950
<i>"The Deciding Moment"</i>

23:58.120 --> 24:00.000
<i>The adventure continues!</i>

24:00.000 --> 24:02.000


24:02.000 --> 24:03.970

